# Frilled Cave-Wurm {3}{U} (2/5): "Descend 4 - This creature gets +2/+0 as long as there are four or more permanent cards in your
# graveyard" (CR 207.2c, 110.4a, 613.4c). The four Moxen pay it on turn 1. On turn 3: Thought Scour on Bot1 mills two Plains (two
# permanent cards: still 2/5), Black Lotus is sacrificed for mana (three: still 2/5), a second Thought Scour on Bot2 puts two Ornithopters (plus the one Bot2 discarded to hand size on turn 2)
# into Bot2's graveyard (six permanent cards in all, but only Bot1's count: still 2/5), and Mind Stone, sacrificed for its "{1}, {T},
# Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card", makes four: exactly the limit, 4/5 (the toughness stays 5). (The Scours, instants, are no
# permanent cards.)

